nd start populating our views with the  correct parameters  simply copy the fields in the correct  place  for the reporting dataset this should be  the name of the dataset where you deploy  the cortex data foundation modules  which in this example is the same  project with the name unicorn reporting  complete the remaining fields  when ready click deploy  at this stage the application is  creating the components we saw in the  diagram  in addition as part of the deployments  the sample code for this application is  added to the cloud source repository for  you to browse and modify  check the readme for detailed breakdown  of components and best practices  you now have a blueprint on how to  consume cortex data foundation insights  from your downstream business  applications deployed on your project  learn more by clicking on the link in  the description below  enjoy  you

